        {
          "text": "LIU Ê 劉鶚 (T. 鐵雲, 鐵翁), Oct. 18, 1857–1909, Aug. 23, scholar and writer, was a native of Tan-t'u, Kiangsu. His father, Liu Ch'êng-chung 劉成忠 (T. 子恕), was a chin-shih of 1852, a compiler of the Hanlin Academy and one time intendant of a circuit in Honan.",
